WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.660
Running your business on HighLevel and Google Sheets?

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.190
Export a CSV.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.240
Clean it up.

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.300
Paste it into Sheets.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.230
And by Friday, it's out of date.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:10.850
Updated a deal stage?

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.470
Need to tag a list, or start a follow-up?

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.160
Now you're back in HighLevel, one record at a time.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.850
Then there's your ads, calls, and payments.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.040
Which campaigns actually turned into customers?

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.400
Sound familiar?

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.670
Meet the Google Sheets integration by LC Bridge,

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.080
built for HighLevel.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.770
And it all happens inside Google Sheets.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.760
No exports, no switching tabs.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.900
Pick the records, fields, and filters you need.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.900
Your HighLevel data lands in Sheets, and stays fresh.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.200
Not just contacts.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.260
Opportunities, appointments, invoices, payments, and more.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:45.660
And contacts and opportunities sync both ways.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.260
Reporting is where it pays off:

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:52.220
25 ready-made reports, from pipeline and lead sources to bookings,

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.670
goals, and invoices.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.890
And we keep adding more, from customer feedback.

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:58.810
Your biggest questions span more than your CRM.

00:00:58.810 --> 00:01:02.130
So connect Facebook Ads, Google Ads, LinkedIn Ads,

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:05.810
CallRail, Stripe, and QuickBooks, with more added every month from customer feedback.

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:08.730
Now your reports work across systems:

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.160
which campaigns booked appointments,

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:12.300
who missed a call, and who still owes you.

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:15.010
Then act on it, in bulk.

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:17.530
Tag those contacts, or enroll them in a workflow,

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:17.950
all at once.

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:20.840
Edit records in bulk, review every change,

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:21.930
then update HighLevel.

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.390
Your CRM and your spreadsheet, in sync.

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:27.790
The Google Sheets integration by LC Bridge.
